fields.description:
Operation mode select. Selects the operation class executed by an offloaded instruction.

Usage: Written before enable or while idle; must match the PARA_OP_SCOPE elaboration setting.

Values:
0x0 GEMM only (reset value);
0x1 element-wise;
0x2 reduction;
0x3 reserved.

Unit: none.

Limits: 2-bit value.
